// =============================================================================================
// HZM coop [user 2026-08-21] WEAPON HANDLING FOLEY.
//
// Per-class mechanical foley for the handling motions the viewmodel already performs but makes no
// sound for: sprinting, crouching, going to sights, switching weapons, the idle inspect, the
// low-ammo mag check, bumping the muzzle into a wall, landing, and dry-firing an empty gun.
//
// Sliced from long-form construction-kit recordings, downsampled to the project convention and
// re-normalised - derivatives, not library files. Close-mic (first-person) perspective throughout;
// the same sources carry a roomier stereo perspective if third-person handling is ever wanted.
//
// "always" is deliberate. An alias only registers if it carries always or a maps list matching the
// current map, and a missing t entry is exactly why the player pain pool was silent for the whole
// Spearhead campaign. These are global, so they say so.
//
// Channel auto: never cuts another cue and is never cut by one. Handling foley overlaps naturally
// (a sprint rustle under a reload), and rate limiting belongs in code, not in channel stealing.
// =============================================================================================

aliascache coop_gf_mg_dry01 sound/coop_gunfoley/mg_dryfire_01.wav soundparms 0.72 0.14 1.0 0.09 90 900 auto loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
aliascache coop_gf_mg_dry02 sound/coop_gunfoley/mg_dryfire_02.wav soundparms 0.72 0.14 1.0 0.09 90 900 auto loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
